ng\" class=\"news-banner__pic2\" />\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"smart-community__news-tab\">\r\n                    <div class=\"news-tab swiper-container\" id=\"news-tab\">\r\n                        <div class=\"my-pagination\"></div>\r\n                        <div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\r\n                            <!--学术报告-->\r\n                            <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\r\n                                <ul>\r\n                                        <li><span>08.06</span><a href=\"https://www.yzu.edu.cn/info/1123/126578.htm\" target=\"_blank\">报告题目：玉米抗病基因挖掘与育种利用研究</a></li>\r\n                                        <li><span>07.29</span><a href=\"https://www.yzu.edu.cn/info/1123/126537.htm\" target=\"_blank\">2026年江苏省研究生“戏曲与曲艺”暑期学校学术报告</a></li>\r\n                                        <li><span>07.29</span><a href=\"https://www.yzu.edu.cn/info/1123/126534.htm\" target=\"_blank\">报告题目：植物核质互作与杂交育种</a></li>\r\n                                        <li><span>07.29</span><a href=\"https://www.yzu.edu.cn/info/1123/126530.htm\" target=\"_blank\">报告题目：复杂场景下航空发动机关键部件缺陷视觉智能检测方法</a></li>\r\n                                        <li><span>07.27</span><a href=\"https://www.yzu.edu.cn/info/1123/126515.htm\" target=\"_blank\">报告题目：高效光电催化与资源化系统转化</a></li>\r\n                                        <li><span>07.27</span><a href=\"https://www.yzu.edu.cn/info/1123/126514.htm\" target=\"_blank\">报告题目：光电催化有机物转化</a></li>\r\n                                </ul>\r\n                                <p><a href=\"https://www.yzu.edu.cn/dtxx/xshd.htm\" target=\"_blank\">MORE<i class=\"iconfont icon-you\"></i></a></p>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <!--学院动态-->\r\n                            <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\r\n                                <ul>\r\n                                        <li><span>08.14</span><a href=\"http://xxgcxy.yzu.edu.cn/info/1073/9333.htm\" target=\"_blan